# valid/staging-overwrite-caught-and-success
profile own
failure stop typed Stop
scope.begin caller
scope.begin action
scope.begin attempt
new b B
stage action field b
scope.unwind attempt stop
catch Stop caught
new c C
stage action field c
staged final action field
new successor S field=final
exit.prepare action successor
scope.end action
exit.commit action caller
check B
use successor
scope.end caller
